-- 0409 - PIRATES HAVE HOMES AND GROUNDS: a pirate wreck is reborn at her home city, mended, manned and stored, and no empty purse strands her;
--        five ocean havens; a roster of 180 pirate ships in 108 fleets that sail from them; a sea's pirates raise its raids by a capped figure
-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- GENERATED by scripts/ops/harness/pacific-pirates/gen-0409.mjs (head.sql + tail.sql + the data). Re-run it; never hand-edit a literal.
